---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — Micro & Calorie Tracker">
  <Navbar />

  <main class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-6 py-10">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <p class="text-[12px] font-mono text-[#888888] uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-[32px] font-semibold tracking-[-1.28px] text-[#171717]">Terms & Conditions.</h1>
      <p class="text-[15px] text-[#4d4d4d] mt-1">Last updated: 2025</p>
    </div>

    <div class="text-[15px] text-[#4d4d4d] leading-[26px] space-y-5">
      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>By using the micro&calorie tracker website and service, you agree to these terms and conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, please do not use our service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Description of Service</h2>
      <p>The micro&calorie tracker provides AI-powered nutrition analysis tools that process meal photos and nutritional data locally in your browser. The service is provided free of charge and does not require account registration. All calculations and data processing occur client-side, and we do not store or transmit your meal data.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Accuracy of Information</h2>
      <p>While we strive for accuracy, the nutritional information provided by our service is for informational and educational purposes only. Nutritional values are estimates based on our reference database and should not be considered medically precise. We recommend consulting a qualified healthcare professional for medical or dietary advice.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">User Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>You agree to use the service for lawful purposes only. You understand that the nutritional information provided is an estimate and should not be used as the sole basis for medical decisions, dietary restrictions, or health treatments. The service is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>The micro&calorie tracker name, logo, and all related content, features, and functionality are owned by us and are protected by applicable intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works without our express written consent.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>The micro&calorie tracker and its creators shall not be liable for any damages arising from the use or inability to use the service. The service is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, either express or implied.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date. Continued use of the service after changes constitutes acceptance of the modified terms.</p>

      <h2 class="text-[20px] font-semibold text-[#171717] tracking-[-0.6px]">Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about these terms, please contact us through our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
